1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,123
Shoppers trust other shoppers.

2
00:00:03,123 --> 00:00:05,955
This video shows how product reviews work:

3
00:00:05,955 --> 00:00:10,614
what buyers see and write, how you approve each review, the settings that

4
00:00:10,614 --> 00:00:14,920
control them, and how ratings help shoppers find the best products.

5
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:23,781
Before they buy, shoppers look for proof that a product is good, and

6
00:00:23,781 --> 00:00:26,430
the best proof is what other buyers say.

7
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:30,292
A review you do not control can be a risk:

8
00:00:30,292 --> 00:00:34,570
spam, abuse, or a complaint about something you do not sell.

9
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:39,629
So every review is a rating from one to five stars, written by

10
00:00:39,629 --> 00:00:43,050
a customer, and approved by you before it shows.

11
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:46,100
The ratings then follow the product:

12
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:50,097
stars on its page, and an average rating that shoppers can sort and

13
00:00:50,097 --> 00:00:51,740
filter your listings by.

14
00:00:55,940 --> 00:01:00,965
A signed-in customer writes a review at the bottom of a product's page:

15
00:01:00,965 --> 00:01:04,750
stars, a title, a few words, and up to three photos.

16
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:10,610
When the customer bought the product, the review is marked Verified purchase.

17
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:17,360
A new or changed review waits under Commerce, Reviews until you approve it or reject it.

18
00:01:18,110 --> 00:01:22,978
Approved reviews show on the product page and count toward its average, which

19
00:01:22,978 --> 00:01:25,500
your listings can filter and sort by.

20
00:01:29,789 --> 00:01:34,495
Under a product's price, its stars, its average rating and its number of

21
00:01:34,495 --> 00:01:36,849
reviews link down to the reviews.

22
00:01:37,323 --> 00:01:42,253
At the bottom of the page, Customer reviews shows the average and the

23
00:01:42,253 --> 00:01:47,643
approved reviews, newest first, each with its stars, title, author and date.

24
00:01:48,333 --> 00:01:51,932
A signed-in customer sees Write a review under the reviews.

25
00:01:51,932 --> 00:01:55,310
A visitor who is not signed in is asked to sign in, and

26
00:01:55,310 --> 00:01:59,519
when your settings allow only buyers to review, a customer who has not

27
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:01,513
bought the product is told so.

28
00:02:05,755 --> 00:02:08,270
Let's write a review as a customer.

29
00:02:08,270 --> 00:02:11,275
Choose Your rating, from one to five stars.

30
00:02:11,935 --> 00:02:15,725
Add a Title, and write Your review in a few words about what

31
00:02:15,725 --> 00:02:17,621
they liked or did not like.

32
00:02:17,621 --> 00:02:21,125
Both are optional, but they help other shoppers decide.

33
00:02:21,594 --> 00:02:23,856
Check the Name shown with your review.

34
00:02:23,856 --> 00:02:27,094
It is filled in for the customer, and they can change it.

35
00:02:27,582 --> 00:02:28,891
Click Send review.

36
00:02:28,891 --> 00:02:32,875
The customer is told that the review will show once you approve it.

37
00:02:32,875 --> 00:02:37,132
They can change it later, and a changed review waits for approval again.

38
00:02:41,376 --> 00:02:43,107
Open Commerce, Reviews.

39
00:02:43,107 --> 00:02:48,121
It lists the reviews waiting for approval, newest first, with the product, the

40
00:02:48,121 --> 00:02:53,136
author, the rating, the title and text, and whether it is a verified purchase.

41
00:02:53,636 --> 00:02:57,433
Click Approve to show a review on its product page, and to count

42
00:02:57,433 --> 00:02:59,656
it in the product's average rating.

43
00:03:00,184 --> 00:03:05,174
Click Reject to keep a review off the product, such as this one, which is spam.

44
00:03:05,648 --> 00:03:09,028
The list beside the count filters by status:

45
00:03:09,028 --> 00:03:13,153
Waiting for approval, Approved, Rejected or Any status.

46
00:03:13,153 --> 00:03:16,398
You can change your mind about any review.

47
00:03:16,856 --> 00:03:19,186
Delete removes a review for good.

48
00:03:23,486 --> 00:03:25,883
Open Settings, Commerce, Reviews.

49
00:03:25,883 --> 00:03:29,324
Approve reviews before they show is on by default.

50
00:03:29,324 --> 00:03:32,826
Untick it to show reviews as soon as they are sent.

51
00:03:33,382 --> 00:03:37,749
Only buyers can review is on by default, so only customers who paid

52
00:03:37,749 --> 00:03:39,783
for a product can review it.

53
00:03:39,783 --> 00:03:44,509
Untick it to let any signed-in customer review, and their reviews are not

54
00:03:44,509 --> 00:03:46,602
marked as verified purchases.

55
00:03:47,215 --> 00:03:51,973
Tick Ask buyers for reviews, and choose the Days after paying, such as fourteen.

56
00:03:51,973 --> 00:03:55,902
Each buyer then gets one email with a link to review each product

57
00:03:55,902 --> 00:03:58,835
they bought, once it has arrived and been used.

58
00:03:59,397 --> 00:04:04,620
Only buyers who agreed to news and offers are asked, and only for recent orders.

59
00:04:04,620 --> 00:04:09,357
This needs your site's email and its base URL, and the Customers module.

60
00:04:13,607 --> 00:04:18,145
Once a product has an approved review, shoppers can sort a listing by

61
00:04:18,145 --> 00:04:23,107
Customer rating, highest first, and the best rated products come to the top.

62
00:04:23,576 --> 00:04:29,403
A listing that chooses its filters automatically also offers a Customer rating filter,

63
00:04:29,403 --> 00:04:32,886
such as four and up, three and up and two and up.

64
00:04:33,343 --> 00:04:37,267
To add them to a listing that has its own filters and sorts,

65
00:04:37,267 --> 00:04:41,429
edit the listing, open Choose filters, and tick Customer rating.

66
00:04:41,429 --> 00:04:44,163
Choose sorts does the same for the sort.

67
00:04:48,363 --> 00:04:50,795
A shop with many similar products:

68
00:04:50,795 --> 00:04:54,623
shoppers sort by customer rating and start with the best.

69
00:04:55,373 --> 00:04:57,940
A store that wants honest feedback:

70
00:04:57,940 --> 00:05:03,073
leave Only buyers can review on, so every review comes from a real customer.

71
00:05:03,823 --> 00:05:04,947
A busy store:

72
00:05:04,947 --> 00:05:09,147
ask buyers for reviews by email a couple of weeks after they pay,

73
00:05:09,147 --> 00:05:12,223
so reviews arrive without anyone chasing them.

74
00:05:12,973 --> 00:05:15,250
A brand that guards its name:

75
00:05:15,250 --> 00:05:19,933
keep approval on, and reject spam and abuse before anyone sees it.

76
00:05:21,933 --> 00:05:26,657
Product reviews turn what your buyers think into proof, under your control.

77
00:05:26,657 --> 00:05:28,173
Thanks for watching.

